    "Mx2-td-ABi.title" : [
      {
        "target" : "Mac เครื่องนี้ต้องใช้ Magic Keyboard เพื่อซื้อสินค้าโดยใช้ Apple Pay ในการดำเนินการต่อ ให้ตั้งค่า Magic Keyboard ของคุณในการตั้งค่าบลูทูธ",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "th"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Denne Macen krever Magic Keyboard for å utføre kjøp med Apple Pay. Konfigurer Magic Keyboard i Bluetooth-valgpanelet for å fortsette.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "no"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Per poder comprar amb l’Apple Pay en aquest Mac, necessites un Magic Keyboard. Per continuar, configura’n un a les preferències de Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "ca"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ovom Macu potreban je Magic Keyboard za obavljanje kupnji pomoću Apple Paya. Za nastavak podesite svoj Magic Keyboard u postavkama Bluetootha.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "hr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Esta Mac requiere un Magic Keyboard para realizar compras mediante Apple Pay. Para continuar, configura uno en las preferencias de Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "es_419"
      },
      {
        "target" : "This Mac requires Magic Keyboard to make purchases using Apple Pay. To continue, set up your Magic Keyboard in Bluetooth Preferences.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "en_AU"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Для використання Apple Pay на цьому Mac потрібна клавіатура Magic Keyboard. Щоб продовжити, налаштуйте клавіатуру Magic Keyboard у параметрах Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "uk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Du skal bruge et Magic Keyboard for at foretage køb på denne Mac med Apple Pay. Indstil dit Magic Keyboard i Bluetooth-indstillingerne for at fortsætte.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "da"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Για να κάνετε αγορές με το Apple Pay σε αυτό το Mac, απαιτείται Magic Keyboard. Για να συνεχίσετε, μεταβείτε στις προτιμήσεις του Bluetooth για να διαμορφώσετε το Magic Keyboard σας.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "el"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ce Mac requiert un clavier Magic Keyboard pour effectuer des achats avec Apple Pay. Pour continuer, configurez votre clavier Magic Keyboard dans les préférences Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "fr_CA"
      },
      {
        "target" : "此Mac需要巧控鍵盤才能透過Apple Pay購買。若要繼續，請在「藍牙」偏好設定中設定你的巧控鍵盤。",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_TW"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Dieser Mac benötigt ein Magic Keyboard, um Einkäufe mit Apple Pay zu tätigen. Konfiguriere dein Magic Keyboard in den Bluetooth-Einstellungen, um fortzufahren.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "de"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Este Mac requer um Magic Keyboard para fazer compras com o Apple Pay. Para continuar, configure o Magic Keyboard nas Preferências de Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_BR"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ce Mac doit être équipé d’un Magic Keyboard pour effectuer des achats avec Apple Pay. Pour continuer, configurez votre Magic Keyboard dans les préférences Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "fr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Do dokonywania zakupów przy użyciu Apple Pay na tym Macu potrzebujesz klawiatury Magic Keyboard. Aby ją skonfigurować, przejdź do preferencji Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "pl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "이 Mac에서 Apple Pay를 이용하여 구입하려면 Magic Keyboard가 필요합니다. 계속하려면 Bluetooth 환경설정에서 Magic Keyboard를 설정하십시오.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "ko"
      },
      {
        "target" : "يحتاج هذا الـ Mac إلى لوحة مفاتيح ماجيك لإجراء عمليات الشراء باستخدام Apple Pay. للمتابعة، قم بإعداد لوحة مفاتيح ماجيك في تفضيلات Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "ar"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Чтобы делать покупки с Apple Pay на этом Mac, необходима клавиатура Magic Keyboard. Откройте настройки Bluetooth и настройте Magic Keyboard, чтобы продолжить.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "ru"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Para fazer compras com o Apple Pay neste Mac, é necessário um teclado Magic Keyboard. Para continuar, configure o teclado Magic Keyboard nas preferências de Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_PT"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Tämä Mac vaatii Magic Keyboardin ostojen tekemiseen Apple Payta käyttäen. Jatka ottamalla Magic Keyboard käyttöön Bluetooth-asetuksissa.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "fi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "此Mac需要妙控键盘才能使用Apple Pay购物。若要继续，请在“蓝牙”偏好设置中设置妙控键盘。",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_CN"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Bu Mac’te Apple Pay’i kullanarak alışveriş yapmak için Magic Keyboard gerekir. Sürdürmek için Bluetooth tercihlerinde Magic Keyboard’unuzu ayarlayın.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "tr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "このMacで、Apple Payを使って購入を行うにはMagic Keyboardが必要です。続けるには、Bluetooth環境設定でMagic Keyboardを設定してください。",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "ja"
      },
      {
        "target" : "This Mac requires Magic Keyboard to make purchases using Apple Pay. To continue, set up your Magic Keyboard in Bluetooth Preferences.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "en_GB"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Mac ini memerlukan Magic Keyboard untuk membuat pembelian menggunakan Apple Pay. Untuk meneruskan, sediakan Magic Keyboard anda dalam Keutamaan Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "ms"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Pro platby s Apple Pay potřebujete na tomto Macu klávesnici Magic Keyboard. Než budete pokračovat, nastavte Magic Keyboard v předvolbách Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "cs"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Om met Apple Pay aankopen te doen op deze Mac, is een Magic Keyboard vereist. Configureer je Magic Keyboard in de Bluetooth-voorkeuren om verder te gaan.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "nl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Acest Mac necesită o tastatură Magic Keyboard pentru a realiza achiziții utilizând Apple Pay. Pentru a continua, configurați tastatura Magic Keyboard în preferințele Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "ro"
      },
      {
        "target" : "इस Mac पर Apple Pay का उपयोग करके ख़रीदारी करने के लिए Magic Keyboard ज़रूरी है। जारी रखने के लिए Bluetooth प्राथमिकता में अपना Magic Keyboard सेटअप करें।",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "hi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Per effettuare acquisti sul Mac tramite Apple Pay è necessaria una tastiera Magic Keyboard. Per continuare, configura Magic Keyboard nelle preferenze Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "it"
      },
      {
        "target" : "此Mac需要精妙鍵盤才能透過Apple Pay進行購買。如要繼續，請在「藍牙偏好設定」中設定精妙鍵盤。",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_HK"
      },
      {
        "target" : "כדי לבצע רכישות באמצעות Apple Pay יש צורך ב-Magic Keyboard ב-Mac. עליך להגדיר את ה-Magic Keyboard שלך דרך העדפות Bluetooth כדי להמשיך.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "he"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Para hacer compras con Apple Pay, este Mac requiere un Magic Keyboard. Para continuar, configura el Magic Keyboard en las preferencias de Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "es"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Máy Mac này yêu cầu có Magic Keyboard để mua sắm bằng Apple Pay. Để tiếp tục, hãy thiết lập Magic Keyboard của bạn trong Tùy chọn Bluetooth.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "vi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ehhez a Machez Magic Keyboard billentyűzet szükséges, hogy fizetni lehessen rajta az Apple Payjel. A folytatáshoz állítsa be a Magic Keyboard billentyűzetét a Bluetooth-beállításokban.",
        "filename" : "PKCardInfoViewController-A222.loctable",
        "language" : "hu"
      },
